{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0234_1000_040tam", "source_sha256": "e7534407e8a8f30cb02d9329eae54f76f0a1ca4ede11aab6eed1718b0e42f8b3", "ja": "ギューン、ババババッ！\nなかなかやるな！　こっちも負けないぞ～！", "zh": "咻——，砰砰砰砰！\n挺能干的嘛！这边也不会输哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
