{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0234_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a7e597661600385492eeaba376fa776748e63410134b003c56c10a0182613402", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだよ。\n衣装、環も気に入ってくれたみたいだな。", "zh": "啊，非常棒。\n看来环也很喜欢这套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0234_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "01506225b88a14f14f878a4159b5d3ba1055d10a02a9e2fee8c9769679082592", "ja": "うん！　たまきこれ好きっ！\nカッコよくて、ヒーローみたいで。", "zh": "嗯！环喜欢这个！\n又帅气，又像英雄一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0234_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ed0236540f7d4303286cf05605f6f31e46086b71fa425d2185e607d344dc9317", "ja": "それはパイロットの衣装って話だけど、\nまあ……ヒーローと言えなくもないか。", "zh": "说的是飞行员的服装，\n不过嘛……也不能说和英雄完全没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0234_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "b54ef258120652ba11971ef0d86d438b25a1ebf1c46798d622053445f72e9219", "ja": "あ、たまき知ってるよ！　パイロットだって。\nそれと……えすえふ？　って言うんだよね！", "zh": "啊，环知道哦！是飞行员，对吧。还有……叫“科幻”？对不对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0234_1008_p", "source_sha256": "92c9d74fc04cb62832fae595ad9e751066b095f9b98cb288e6a4f906b04fda7a", "ja": "お、そうそう。SFっぽい感じだ。よくわかったな。", "zh": "哦，对对，就是很有科幻感。你还真了解啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0234_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "6fcfa11246e8b7a09d6a001c4446a9e88d59b8d4f83df7acb00fb0cb6805492f", "ja": "くふふ♪　みさきに聞いたんだぞ～。\nこの衣装のこと、もっと知りたかったから。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪我去问了美咲哦～  \n因为我想多了解一些这套服装的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0234_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "b275cee0d3385561cf957521b4169a1a0f7cbc4ed589ddc043a840891dd8348e", "ja": "髪型もいつもと違うんだよ。\nこっちもえすえふにしてもらったんだ～！", "zh": "发型也和以前不一样哦。\n这个也是让造型师帮我弄的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0234_1011_p", "source_sha256": "af82cdc2dc47a94a3f3c602e46e514d4f655ca589b32288519b77f6103cfab80", "ja": "ああ、衣装によく合ってると思うよ。\nなんだかいつもより、お姉さんっぽく見えるな。", "zh": "啊，我觉得很适合这套服装。\n总感觉比平时更像个姐姐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0234_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "243cd98a1cf6aaef4236d3f93076d6f126f0f58095c9f8a7af9f170c5047ddfc", "ja": "ホント？　やったぞ～、くふふ♪\nでもおやぶん、髪って面白いね。", "zh": "真的？太好了～咕呼呼♪\n不过老大，头发真有意思啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
