{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_040tam0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_040tam0234_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "6460d539d3a4986ec5108203fe2c1ae79e9e5aa6a7dc39d6f2a492a53068b97d", "ja": "たまき、この衣装も髪型も大好きだけど……。\nおやぶんの話聞いて、もっと好きになったぞ～！", "zh": "环很喜欢这套服装和发型，不过……听了老大的话之后，就更喜欢了哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
